# Weiler: German texts in the informal address ("du") of the Weiler interface.
# Overrides entries of the RTTR translation (rttr-de.po) and the German mission texts of the RTTR campaign scripts
# (msgid = the original German text of the script). Merged before rttr-de.po at build time (msgcat --use-first).
